Fire out an orb of light that deals [83, 112, 135, 154, 171 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light damage and then returns, dealing the same amount of damage again and reducing the cooldown by half ([6, 5, 4, 4, 4 (TL1-5)]) when it reaches you. The damage will increase with your spellpower. The ball will travel at most 28 distance to return to you.
